      <p>Aviation Legislation Amendment (Liability and Insurance) Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 148, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to aviation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
